# Shared prefix: boot to the world wheel on the save in slot 1. Waits for the title
# screen's menu file instead of counting presses from boot (a press during a screen
# transition is lost, so fixed press counts break when loading times change), then
# presses with gaps long enough for each transition: title, Adventure, slot 1.
filemark
until file adv_main_menu mash A period 1.4 timeout 90
wait 4
tap A
wait 4
tap A
wait 4
tap A
wait 5
